<title>UK: BOE invites fixed rate ops, residual shortage 497.</title>
<headline>BOE invites fixed rate ops, residual shortage 497.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited a round of fixed rate operations, comprising 6.0 percent repos to April 1 and 2 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before April 2.</p>
<p>The residual liquidity shortage is 497 million stg.</p>
</text>
